          "h2_subtitle": "Welcome to the realm of ASIC Verification mastery, a journey we embark on together through this blog,&nbsp;The Art of Verification. This platform is dedicated to those who are committed to honing their ASIC Verification skills via self-learning, with a focus on System Verilog, UVM, and developing the critical thinking process every verification engineer should possess.",
